$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound 7. To a solution of 8 (26.5 mg, 64.1 μmol) in MePh (1 mL) was
added Grubbs2nd catalyst (4.30 mg, 5.06 μmol) under Ar atmosphere. The
mixture was stirred at 100 °C in a sealed tube for 24 h. Then the
resulting black solution was cooled to rt, and the other portion of
catalyst (4.50 mg, 5.30 μmol ) was added. The mixture was continued to
stir at 100 °C for additional 24 h. After filtration and removing the
volatiles, the residue was purified by chromatography on silica gel
(EtOAc/petroleum ether, 1:20). 7 (21.5 mg, 87%) as a colorless oil. [α]20
D -73.0 (c 1.00, CHCl3); IR (film) ν 2998, 2925, 2858, 1730, 1611, 1512,
1455, 1335, 1247, 1158, 1090, 1035, 937, 814, 729, 663, 547; 1H NMR
(CDCl3, 300 MHz) δ 1.46 (s, 3H), 1.50-1.63 (m, 1H), 1.67 (s, 3H),
1.83-2.02 (m, 1H), 2.37 (s, 3H), 2.73 (dd, J=14.3, 8.0 Hz, 1H), 2.90-3.11
(m, 2H), 3.59 (dd, J=14.6, 6.5 Hz, 1H), 3.80 (s, 3H), 4.26-4.36 (m, 1H),
6.78 (d, J=8.4 Hz, 2H), 7.05 (d, J=8.7 Hz, 2H), 7.12 (d, J=8.1 Hz, 2H),
7.41 (d, J=8.1 Hz, 2H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 75.47 MHz) δ 17.2, 18.7, 21.3,
29.1, 38.0, 38.5, 55.1, 59.0, 113.5, 125.7, 125.9, 127.0, 128.2, 129.0,
130.3, 137.9, 142.5, 158.1. MS (ESI) m/z 386.1 (M + H), 408.1 (M + Na).
HRMS (MALDI) calcd for C22H27NO3S + H 386.1784; Found: 386.1788.
