$DATUM (6Z,9E)-9-(2-(Benzyloxy)ethyl)-2,3,3a,4,5,8-hexahydro-1H-cyclopenta[8]annulene
(6e). Compound 4e (0.32 mmol, 0.10 g) was dissolved in DCM (25 mL) and
argon was bubbled through the solution for 15 min. Grubbs 2nd generation
catalyst (0.016 mmol, 0.013 g) was dissolved in DCM (12 mL) and argon was
bubbled through the solution also for 15 min. Solution of Grubbs 2nd
generation catalyst was transferred to the solution of 4f and reaction
mixture was stirred under reflux for 2 h. Then the solvent was evaporated
under reduced pressure and under argon atmosphere. Column chromatography
of the residue on silica gel (2/1 hexanes/EtOAc), 0.078 g (86%) of the
title compound as a yellow liquid. Rf (2/1 hexanes/EtOAc) = 0.66; 1H NMR
(600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.36-7.33 (m,4H), 7.30-7.27 (m, 1H), 5.84-5.79 (m,
1H), 5.54-5.50 (m, 1H), 4.53 (s, 2H), 3.57-3.50 (m, 2H), 3.13-3.09 (m,
1H), 2.95-2.92 (m, 1H), 2.45-2.35 (m, 3H), 2.32-2.19 (m, 4H), 1.88-1.82
(m, 1H), 1.67-1.50 (m, 3H), 1.42-1.38 (m, 1H), 1.30-1.24 (m, 1H); 13C NMR
(151 MHz, CDCl3) δ 142.0, 138.7, 132.0, 129.7, 128.6, 128.3, 127.5,
127.4, 72.9, 69.1, 43.2, 36.0, 35.7, 33.8, 32.4, 31.1, 26.9, 24.4.; IR
(KBr) νmax 3324, 3084, 3028, 2938, 2860, 1721, 1658, 1458, 1368, 1272,
1096, 1033, 734, 695 cm-1; HRMS (TOF-MS-CI) m/z: [M + H]+ calcd for
C20H26O 282.1984; found 282.1987.
