$DATUM (5S,6R)-5-(2-(4-methoxybenzyloxy)ethyl)-6-methylcyclohex-3-enol (11): To
a solution of Hoveyda-Grubbs II catalyst (0.106 g, 0.13 mmol) in 150 mL
DCM was added diene (8.00 g, 25.15 mmol) and the mixture was stirred for
3 h at room temperature. The solvent was removed under reduced pressure
and the crude product was purified by flash chromatography on silica (20%
EtOAc/hexanes). Alcohol 11 (5.90 g, 85%) as a colorless liquid. Rf
(hexane/ethyl acetate 7:3) 0.40; IR (film): 3418, 2912, 1613, 1586, 1514,
1463, 1363, 1173, 1036, 821 cm-1; 1H-NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.24 (d, J =
8.44 Hz, 2H), 6.86 (d, J = 8.44 Hz, 2H), 5.55 (m, 2H), 4.42 (s, 2H), 3.79
(s, 3H), 3.48 (m, 2H), 2.22 (m, 1H), 1.95 (m, 3H), 1.58 (m, 3H), 1.12 (m,
3H); 13C-NMR (100.6 MHz, CDCl3): δ 159.1, 130.5, 130.4, 130.1, 129.2,
129.1, 123.5, 122.96, 113.7, 72.6, 72.6, 72.5, 68.6, 67.9, 67.8, 60.4,
55.2, 40.7, 40.3, 37.3, 37.2, 34.1, 33.9, 33.1, 32.3, 21.0, 15.5; HRMS-EI
(m/z) [M]+ calcd for C17H24O3 276.1725, found 276.1725.
