$DATUM (R)-1-((R)-3,6-Dihydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)pent-4-en-2-yl Acetate (8). Grubbs
second generation catalyst (5 mg, 6 μmol, 1 mol %) was added to a
solution of allyl ether 6 (143 mg, 600 μmol, 1 equiv) in CH2Cl2 (120 mL)
at 40 °C. After 60 min, the solvent was removed in vacuo, and the residue
was subjected to flash chromatography (SiO2, hexanes:EtOAc, 90:10).
Dihydropyran 8 (108 mg, 0.51 mmol) as a brownish oil in 85% yield. TLC
(SiO2). R f = 0.37 (hexanes/EtOAc 90:10). [α]D 25 = -5 (c 1.0, CHCl3),
[α]D,lit. = -5 (c 1.0, CHCl3).6
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
