$DATUM tert-Butyl(((1R,3aE,6Z,9aS)-2,2-dimethyl-4-(trimethylsilyl)-2,3,5,8,9,9a-hexahydro-1H-cyclopenta[8]annulen-1-yl)oxy)dimethylsilane
(6j). Compound 4j (0.24 mmol, 0.10 g) was dissolved in DCM (15 mL) and
argon was bubbled through the solution for 15 min. Grubbs 2nd generation
catalyst (0.012 mmol, 0.010 g) was dissolved in DCM (10 mL) and argon was
bubbled through the solution also for 15 min. Solution of Grubbs 2nd
generation catalyst was transferred to the solution of 4k and the
reaction mixture was stirred under reflux for 2 h. Then, the solvent was
evaporated under reduced pressure and under argon atmosphere. Column
chromatography of the residue on silica gel (hexanes), 0.081 g (85%) of
the title compound as a colorless solid. Mp 51.6-52.0 °C. Rf (hexanes) =
0.52; 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 5.80-5.75 (m, 1H), 5.54-5.50 (m, 1H),
3.30 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 3.10-3.06 (m, 1H), 2.68 (t, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H),
2.49-2.43 (m, 1H), 2.36 (q, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 2.20-2.13 (m, 2H), 1.97 (d,
J = 14.4 Hz, 1H), 1.94-1.90 (m, 1H), 1.20-1.13 (m, 1H), 0.98 (s, 3H0,
0.92 (s, 9H), 0.78 (s, 3H), 0.12 (s, 9H), 0.08 (s, 6H); 13C NMR (151 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 154.0, 134.1, 133.2, 129.1, 87.8, 53.4, 47.0, 40.5, 32.0, 31.5,
27.3, 26.6, 26.0, 19.8, 18.3, 0.2, -3.9, -4.2. IR (KBr) νmax 3016, 2956,
2929, 2893, 2854, 1461, 1245, 1129, 1102, 872, 836, 776 cm-1; HRMS
(TOF-MS-CI) m/z: [M + H]+ calcd for C22H42OSi2 378.2774; found 378.2775.
